{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Not a dog will sharpen its tongue.</b> That it will frighten them, like <i>none sharpened its tongue against the children of Israel</i> (Joshua 10:21). And the meaning is that it will bark or bite, and behold, in the land no dog will sharpen its tongue against them or against their beasts, and all the more so [that] He will send from heaven a destroyer to strike their firstborn."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:19.855450893Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}